            <a class="day-link quiz" href="第1周_文化与制度启蒙/Day_04_练习题.html">✏️ 练习题</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="day-col">
          <div class="day-num">Day 05</div>
          <div class="day-topic">奖惩制度与安全规定</div>
